        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Bommer BB5050-454G1-652, 4-1/2\" x 4\"  Slip In Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSpecial half slip in type hinge used for aluminum store front doors. One leaf slips into door frame (leaf holes are tapped and threaded #12-24). One leaf standard mortise (normally mounted to door). Medium duty door hinge, standard .134\" thickness with 5 knuckle design and button tips. BHMA certified architectural grade hinges. Made in the USA.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/bommer-BB5050-454-G1-hinge_size.gif?v=1704354533\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer BB5050-454-G1 Slip In Hinge Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Bommer made in the USA\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Bommer BB5050-454-G1 Slip In Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome Finish</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>2 Ball Bearings for Smooth Action</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.134\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #12-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified Hinge</li>\r\n<li>Handed, Field Reversible</li>\r\n<li>Non-Rising Removable Pin</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Half Slip In (Threaded #12-24), Half Mortise</li> \r\n<li>Conforms to ANSI A8112 for Ball Bearing Hinges</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BB5050-454-G1.pdf?v=1691094996\" target=\"new\"><b>Bommer BB5050-454-G1 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage with matching finish machine screws. For use with store front type aluminum doors and door frames.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** These hinges are normally special order 3-5 weeks to ship.</b>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually (1 door hinge)</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is Discontinued. See available <a href=\"/collections/hinges\">Door Hinges</a>.</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
